<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Burns appoints head of food unit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Burns appoints head of food unit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food ingredients group Burns Philp &amp; Co Ltd said on Friday that Ned Skinner has been appointed president of its Industrial/Food Service division, which has annual sales of over A$580 million.</p>
<p>Burns Philp said Skinner would take up his appointment from November 8 and will be based at Ankeny, Iowa.</p>
<p>Before joining Burns Philip, Skinner was Vice President of Starch and Speciality Products for Tate &amp; Lyle Plc's U.S. unit A.E. Staley manufacturing company.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
